
* Resistor SPICE subcircuit
* Model with parasitic series inductance and parallel capacitance
*
* Equivalent circuit:
*
*              ┌── Cp ──┐
*   1 ── ESL ──┤        ├── 2
*              └── R ───┘
*
* Behavior:
*   f << SRF: Z ≈ R (purely resistive)
*   f ~ SRF:  Parallel resonance of L and Cp; impedance peaks for low R,
*             dips for high R
*   f >> SRF: Cp dominates (capacitive roll-off)
*
* Parameters:
*   RVAL - Resistance value in ohms
*   ESL  - Parasitic series inductance (henries)
*   CP   - Parasitic parallel capacitance (farads)

.SUBCKT R 1 2 PARAMS: RVAL=1k ESL=0.5n CP=0.05p
L_esl 1 mid {ESL}
R1 mid 2 {RVAL}
C_p mid 2 {CP}
.ENDS R
XR1 V3V3 SCL R RVAL=4.7k ESL=700p CP=80f


V_33 V3V3 GND DC 3.3
* GY-9250 module pull-up to its own LDO output (~3.3 V), bus capacitance: pins + 3 cm trace + module ~ 60 pF
R_MOD MOD_33 SCL 10k
V_MOD MOD_33 GND DC 3.3
C_BUS SCL GND 60p
* ESP32-S3 open-drain low at 400 kHz (1.25 us low / 1.25 us released); low windows 1-2.25 us, 3.5-4.75 us, 6-7.25 us ...
V_CLK CK GND PULSE(0 1 1u 5n 5n 1.25u 2.5u)
S_OD SCL GND CK GND SWOD
.model SWOD SW(RON=25 ROFF=1e9 VT=0.5 VH=0.1)
.control
  tran 1n 12u
  meas tran t30 WHEN v(SCL)=0.99 RISE=3
  meas tran t70 WHEN v(SCL)=2.31 RISE=3
  meas tran vol MAX v(SCL) FROM=6.2u TO=7.2u
  meas tran vhigh MIN v(SCL) FROM=5.2u TO=5.95u
.endc
